## 7 — Example AI Studio action wiring (suggested)

1. Start node: Input collection prompt (store JSON)
2. Planner node: Planner prompt (use stored JSON) -> returns schedule
3. For each day: call Checklist generator and Tips generator (or call once and map by subject)
4. Validation node: check total allocated minutes <= available minutes; if not, return recommendation message.
5. Final node: format human-readable plan + JSON export link (or copy-paste block) for submission.

